Significance: minor
Type: added

Posts to Podcast: new Create tab in the Podcast dashboard for generating episode drafts from posts via the wpcom-side pipeline. Pick posts to include or use a recent-posts window, steer the output with a free-form prompt, and watch a remaining-credits indicator backed by the quota-snapshot endpoint. Generated drafts surface in the Episodes listing alongside posts in the configured podcast category. The top-level tab order is now Create, Episodes, Distribution, Stats, Settings.
